@ythe Oaken Defender@n~
@yAn ancient treant stands guard, its bark scarred by a thousand seasons.@n
~
@yCalled out of Trorxek, the Staff of Ancient Oaks, the Oaken Defender is less
a summoned creature than a promise kept.  Its trunk is knotted oak grown black
with age, its arms are limbs thick enough to shatter a shield wall, and its
eyes are two slow amber lights set deep in the grain.  It does not speak.  It
simply places itself between its caller and whatever is coming.@n
~
